  "title": "Savory Lower-Carb Butternut Squash Muffins",
  "description": "This quick bread recipe delivers moist muffins flavored with rosemary and brown sugar, making them both savory and sweet. Eat them for dinner and breakfast.",
  "authors": [
    "clarkandstephaniemoore"
